# BUILD ÇOMMÆNDS
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ

```bash
# Normæl build from the consuming æpp's merged deployment
docker compose --env-file .env -f docker-compose.main.yaml build

# Force rebuild from scrætch
docker compose --env-file .env -f docker-compose.main.yaml build --pull --no-cache

# Clæssic-builder smoke test for æ chænged shæred/flættened context
DOCKER_BUILDKIT=0 docker compose --env-file .env -f docker-compose.main.yaml build --no-cache <service...>
```
